<div class="container my-5">
  <h2 class="text-center text-primary mb-4">About Telugu Community Hamburg e.V.</h2>

  <p class="lead text-justify">
    <strong>Telugu Community Hamburg (TCH) e.V.</strong> is a non-profit organization formed by individuals of Telugu origin residing in and around Hamburg, Germany.
  </p>

  <h4 class="text-danger-emphasis mt-4 alert alert-info">Our Mission</h4>
  <p class="text-justify">
    The mission of the association is to integrate and strengthen our bonds by forging new friendships across all communities, cultures, and borders. We aim to create a home away from our motherland while retaining our cultural roots and traditions.
  </p>

  <h4 class="text-danger-emphasis alert alert-info mt-4">Our Purpose</h4>
  <p class="text-justify">
    The purpose of TCH e.V. is to promote popular education, international outlook, tolerance in all areas of culture, and the idea of international understanding.
    The association exclusively and directly pursues non-profit goals in accordance with the “Tax-privileged purposes” section of the German tax code.
  </p>

  <h4 class="text-danger-emphasis alert alert-info  mt-4">How We Fulfill Our Purpose</h4>
  <ul class="list-group list-group-flush">
    <li class="list-group-item">
      🎭 <strong>Cultural Events:</strong> Regular public organization of cultural festivals and exhibitions celebrating Telugu culture to encourage cross-cultural exchange.
    </li>
    <li class="list-group-item">
      📚 <strong>Language Education:</strong> Public Telugu and Sanskrit language lessons for children, youth, and adults interested in Telugu culture.
    </li>
    <li class="list-group-item">
      🌍 <strong>Integration Support:</strong> Teaching German to newcomers with an emphasis on cultural inclusivity and linguistic proficiency to foster unity among diverse communities.
    </li>
    <li class="list-group-item">
      🛡️ <strong>Community Assistance:</strong> Providing guidance and support to local authorities during emergencies, enhancing response capabilities to ensure community safety.
    </li>
    <li class="list-group-item">
      🧘‍♀️ <strong>Health & Wellness:</strong> Promoting physical activities such as yoga and sports to encourage healthy living, mental strength, and community well-being.
    </li>
  </ul>
</div>
